# Play test of the plan 'The Sunken Kingdom' (CIPlay plan_sunken_kingdom, in a test world 'CI ...'): no Raft story -
# each island's WHEN brings the next (a quest, a signal, a zone, a rule, a step); every stop is tuned to and played to
# its end with its own test, except that the Spire is played to RESTORE and the Hollow then checks the RESTORE answer;
# then the shuttle wreck, sailed to (km 4).
plan The Sunken Kingdom
tune spire
include spirecrest_roofs.play
expect chain overpass unlocked
tune overpass
include overpass_shoal.play
expect chain brinelab unlocked
tune brinelab
include brinelab_tower.play
expect chain biome unlocked
tune biome
include biome_seven.play
expect chain thalassa unlocked
tune thalassa
include thalassa_mooring.play
expect chain shelf unlocked
tune shelf
include lumen_shelf.play
expect chain caisson unlocked
tune caisson
include caisson_yard.play
expect chain hadal unlocked
tune hadal
include hadal_commons.play
expect chain sealkeeper unlocked
tune sealkeeper
include sealkeeper_spire.play
expect chain hollow unlocked
expect story restorechoice 1
tune hollow
island The Stalker's Hollow
offset 0 0
air chain_air
zone lip
read Warden's last entry
zone alcove_1
air alcove_1
zone arena
kill Angler fish
wait 3
expect story stalkerhurt 1
zone alcove_2
air alcove_2
expect story stalker 1
zone valve
use valve
expect shown teal
expect hidden gatebars
expect shown lastrestore
expect hidden plug
read What the Ringwave means (part 1)
zone alcove_4
read The last word
zone surface_line
expect done
# the shuttle rule is km:4 (ahead:450): sail on first, as in plan_gravity_sea
sail 4
arrive shuttle
include shuttlewreck_reef.play
expect blueprints
plan end
